  "description": "DOBQAQ crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C24 H56 Cl6 N48 Nd6 O8 4+,6(H2 O1),4(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 4 O neighbors; Nd1A (Nd) has 4 O neighbors; Nd1B (Nd) has 4 O neighbors; Nd1O (Nd) has 4 O neighbors; Nd1P (Nd) has 4 O neighbors; Nd1Q (Nd) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.034-4.054 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.98-112.62°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd6(μ3-OH)8Cl6(μ2-4-NH2-1,2,4-Triaz)12][Cl4]·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
